This package implements CASE (Competencies and Academic Standards Exchange) 1.1 and 1.0: the model of a framework package, its
readers, the conversion between the versions, and a client and a provider of the REST binding. It includes no file of 1EdTech:
the JSON schemas that its tests read are downloaded at pinned hashes and never committed.

